      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1916-10-14_WidnesExaminer_art0119" n="art0119">
        <head>--uiiiont Film Hire Service. iiilaaf Q4Ci1QQ3C404Q44,Q,JQJ4,4i10412)2444‘,44,1Q4C4Jeg400444e1 – _ _</head>
        <p>--uiiiont Film Hire Service. iiilaaf Q4Ci1QQ3C404Q44,Q,JQJ4,4i10412)2444‘,44,1Q4C4Jeg400444e1 - _ _</p>
        <p>The Large and continual flow of persons who come to me for Spectacles through the recommendation of their friends is proof of the benefit derived from my thorough system of sight-testing in which is combined scientific knowledge, long experience, and the greatest of care. My prices for spectacles are as</p>
