        <p>PRIVATE b. M. MELVIN. Died of Wounds.</p>
        <p>Lance-Corporal Guy, who was nineteen years of age, and educated at the Wycliffe and Heath_ side Schools, Was formerly employed by Messrs. Randall's, tanners. He had been at the Front about fifteen months. His father has served at the Front with the same battalion, and after being wounded three times was discharged. He is nbw employed at Randall's Tannery..</p>
